'' 'f( ).a += 1' over a BITFIELD evaluates f( ) once, as fbc does: the probe, the read and the store
'' each lowered the base, so it ran three times (expressions/selfbops.bas).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc tests/codegen/src/bitfield-compound-base-once.bas -o tests/codegen/bitfieldcompoundbaseonce.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/bitfieldcompoundbaseonce.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  1             1             0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  2             5
